#: imageeffect_sheartool.cpp:65 imageeffect_sheartool.cpp:305
#: imageplugin_sheartool.cpp:63
msgid "Shear Tool"
msgstr "Ferramenta de Inclinazón"

#: imageeffect_sheartool.cpp:67
msgid "A digiKam image plugin to shear an image."
msgstr "Un plugin de digiKam para inclinar imaxes."

#: imageeffect_sheartool.cpp:73
msgid "Author and maintainer"
msgstr "Autoria e mantimento"

#: imageeffect_sheartool.cpp:76
msgid "Shear algorithm"
msgstr "Algoritmo de inclinazón"

#: imageeffect_sheartool.cpp:81
msgid ""
"<p>This is the shearing image operation preview. If you move the mouse cursor "
"on this preview, a vertical and horizontal dashed line will be drawn to guide "
"you in adjusting the shearing correction. Release the left mouse button to "
"freeze the dashed line's position."
msgstr ""
"<p>Esta é a antevisión da operazón de inclinazón da imaxe. Se move o cursor do "
"rato nesta antevisión debuxará-se unha liña discontínua vertical e horizontal "
"para guiá-lo no axuste da operazón de inclinazón. Prema no botón direito do "
"rato para fixar a posizón das liñas discontínuas."

#: imageeffect_sheartool.cpp:96
msgid "New width:"
msgstr "Nova largura:"

#: imageeffect_sheartool.cpp:97 imageeffect_sheartool.cpp:101
#: imageeffect_sheartool.cpp:297 imageeffect_sheartool.cpp:298
msgid " px"
msgstr " píxels"

#: imageeffect_sheartool.cpp:100
msgid "New height:"
msgstr "Nova altura:"

#: imageeffect_sheartool.cpp:112
msgid "Main horizontal angle:"
msgstr "Ángulo horizontal principal:"

#: imageeffect_sheartool.cpp:116
msgid "<p>The main horizontal shearing angle, in degrees."
msgstr "<p>A ángulo de inclinazón horizontal principal, en graus."

#: imageeffect_sheartool.cpp:120
msgid "Fine horizontal angle:"
msgstr "Ángulo horizontal fino:"

#: imageeffect_sheartool.cpp:124
msgid ""
"<p>This value in degrees will be added to main horizontal angle value to set "
"fine adjustments."
msgstr ""
"<p>Este valor en graus será engadido ao ángulo horizontal principal para "
"permitir axustes finos."

#: imageeffect_sheartool.cpp:129
msgid "Main vertical angle:"
msgstr "Ángulo vertical principal:"

#: imageeffect_sheartool.cpp:133
msgid "<p>The main vertical shearing angle, in degrees."
msgstr "<p>A ángulo de inclinazón vertical principal, en graus."

#: imageeffect_sheartool.cpp:137
msgid "Fine vertical angle:"
msgstr "Ángulo vertical fino:"

#: imageeffect_sheartool.cpp:141
msgid ""
"<p>This value in degrees will be added to main vertical angle value to set fine "
"adjustments."
msgstr ""
"<p>Este valor en graus será engadido ao ángulo vertical principal para permitir "
"axustes finos."

#: imageeffect_sheartool.cpp:146
msgid "Anti-Aliasing"
msgstr "Anti-Aliasing"

#: imageeffect_sheartool.cpp:147
msgid ""
"<p>Enable this option to process anti-aliasing filter to the sheared image. To "
"smooth the target image, it will be blurred a little."
msgstr ""
"<p>Active esta opzón para procesar un filtro de anti-aliasing (suavizazón) para "
"suavizar a imaxe inclinada. Cando a suavice, a imaxe quedará lixeiramente "
"difuminada."

#: imageplugin_sheartool.cpp:43
msgid "Shear..."
msgstr "Inclinar..."

